"plugins.help" = "Plugins connect tool servers that you add yourself. During assistance the model calls only the tools you approved as read-only, without asking each time. Results the answer cites are saved to the task automatically with their source (plugin, tool, time). Turning a plugin off stops its calls at once and clears assistance that used it; saved results stay in task memory.";
"plugins.dataNotice" = "The model writes the tool arguments itself; they may include text from your task and are sent to the plugin's server. Each model step sends the full task context and uses your subscription limit (up to 5 steps per request). Every call is listed in the call log.";
"plugins.readOnlyWarning" = "“Read only” is what the plugin's server declares about its tools. Ambient offers the model only tools marked this way and stops using a tool when the server changes its description, but it cannot guarantee what a third-party server actually does.";
"plugins.removeNotice" = "The plugin and its sign-in keys will be removed. Results it already saved stay in task memory as history; you can forget them there.";
